      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Allot of clients have either gotten their issue resolved or remain unchanged, whatever is causing the notification system to not generally work is really confusing. I would actually get a notification pop up of someone adding me or asking me to join the world I'm in, but that would be only like once and I would never get any kind of notification again. The notification system definitely either needs to have a big fix or it just needs to be remade in general. It may or may not be the case that the move to the new Unity version has broken some things about the game, but whatever has broken the notification system was done about maybe two months ago at this moment.",
      "viewerReactions": null
